  "modified": "2026-10-21T19:51:36Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: remote code execution via state corruption after a\n     bailout and via stale request-global state\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109618-CVE-2026-109619.patch: PHP security\n       team's minimal mitigation for EOL branches: report allocator\n       overflow and out-of-memory errors via zend_mm_safe_error_ex() and\n       _exit() instead of bailing out, reset executor, SAPI and request\n       globals on shutdown, add overflow checks to the CONCAT and\n       FAST_CONCAT handlers, keep only the Content-Disposition and\n       Content-Type multipart headers and ignore duplicates, and disable\n       the session upload progress callback, in Zend/*, main/*,\n       ext/session/session.c\n     - CVE-2026-109618\n     - CVE-2026-109619",
